        "**Confirm the diagnosis first.** NICE NG71 is explicit: refer a person with suspected Parkinson's disease **quickly and untreated** to a specialist; do not start dopaminergic therapy in primary care to 'see if it works'. Stop any offending drug and review in 4-8 weeks before labelling anyone as having PD.",
